                                                "sense_id": "1248c80b-437c-3b29-b1b2-b8b36863ef8a",
                                                "text": "\"I so glad - so glad the wicked thing not hurt my sissy!\" and in that moment of thankful joy the two children embraced each other with fond affection."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "edd949ca-4c26-4f3f-bda1-32d7b5452652",
                                                "sense_id": "1248c80b-437c-3b29-b1b2-b8b36863ef8a",
                                                "text": "Her seven-year-old brother Justin sat on my lap beside her casket. I explained to him why we were staying with his sissy. He wouldn't leave; he stayed, too. He kissed her, touched her hand, told her he would miss her."
                                            }
                                        ]
